  "details": "   * SECURITY UPDATE: gettext loads message catalogs from arbitrary paths via LANGUAGE directory traversal\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-84243.patch: gettext loads message catalogs from arbitrary paths via LANGUAGE directory traversal\n     - CVE-2026-84243\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: ld.so $ORIGIN rpath handling for AT_SECURE programs reads/writes out of bounds and opens the unvalidated path (also fixes CVE-2026-86805)\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-95818.patch: ld.so $ORIGIN rpath handling for AT_SECURE programs reads/writes out of bounds and opens the unvalidated path (also fixes CVE-2026-86805)\n     - CVE-2026-95818\n     - CVE-2026-86805\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: nscd stack overflow via alloca on large DNS responses\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-89092.patch: nscd: replace alloca with malloc in aicache, hstcache\n     - CVE-2026-89092\n   * SECURITY UPDATE: resolver assertion failure on search list truncation\n     - debian/patches/CVE-2026-8674.patch: resolv: fix assertion failure on search list truncation\n     - CVE-2026-8674\n   * debian/testsuite-xfail-debian.mk: mark tests that fail under qemu-user\n     emulation on the armel build farm as expected failures.",
